<!--
  ******************************************************************
  * Build        : pom.xml
  * Application  : CardDemo
  * Type         : Apache Maven build configuration (Java 25 LTS, Spring Boot 3.5.11)
  * Function     : Sole build descriptor for the CardDemo modular monolith that
  *                replaces the z/OS execution substrate of the frozen COBOL
  *                corpus held in app/. It compiles, tests, measures, scans and
  *                packages exactly ONE executable Spring Boot JAR from the Java
  *                sources under src/, and it is simultaneously the validation
  *                gate dependency file: the zero warning compile, the 80 percent
  *                line coverage floor, the toolchain floors and the dependency
  *                vulnerability scan are all asserted from this file.
  *
  *                Originating legacy corpus, read only and never touched by this
  *                build: 28 COBOL programs in app/cbl (19,254 lines), 28
  *                copybooks in app/cpy (2,614 lines), 17 BMS mapsets in app/bms
  *                with their 17 generated symbolic maps in app/cpy-bms (460
  *                input field contracts), 29 JCL members in app/jcl (note the
  *                uppercase CREASTMT.JCL, which a lowercase glob silently
  *                drops), 2 procedures in app/proc, the IDCAMS control card
  *                app/ctl/REPROCT.ctl, the CICS resource definitions
  *                app/csd/CARDDEMO.CSD, the VSAM catalogue listing
  *                app/catlg/LISTCAT.txt and the 9 ASCII fixtures in
  *                app/data/ASCII.
  *
  *                Superseded z/OS build tooling: the compile templates
  *                samples/BATCMP.jcl (batch COBOL), samples/CICCMP.jcl (CICS
  *                COBOL) and samples/BMSCMP.jcl (BMS map assembly), plus the
  *                build procedures samples/BUILDBAT.prc, samples/BUILDBMS.prc
  *                and samples/BUILDONL.prc. Those six members remain in
  *                samples/ as reference and are out of scope; this single file
  *                replaces the whole set conceptually. The resource install job
  *                app/jcl/CBADMCDJ.jcl has no build analogue and is superseded
  *                at runtime by the Spring Security configuration.
